# ── Required ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The Odds API — free tier at https://the-odds-api.com (500 req/month)
# Generate a key at https://the-odds-api.com/account/ and paste it below.
ODDS_API_KEY=<your_odds_api_key_here>

# ── Optional ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Discord webhook for scheduler notifications (pre-game/post-game job alerts).
# Create one at: Discord Server → Settings → Integrations → Webhooks → New Webhook
# DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL=https://discord.com/api/webhooks/<id>/<token>

# Override the default data directory (default: ironclad-v2/data/)
# IRONCLAD_DATA_DIR=/path/to/data

# Override DuckDB database path (default: $IRONCLAD_DATA_DIR/ironclad.ddb)
# IRONCLAD_DB_PATH=/path/to/ironclad.ddb

# Log format: "text" (default) or "json" (for log aggregators like Loki/CloudWatch)
# IRONCLAD_LOG_FORMAT=json
